  "details": "((I could not find “Suggestions” on here, so sorry if this is in the wrong spot. ))\n\nmaybe you guys already do this, If so then ignore this\n\nWhen someone exports anything with the Tag Sexually suggestive. It should only show up for people who are age verified. Same with groups. I feel as long as it is easy to click (This is age gated content) Most people will click it before exporting.\n\nWhen someone tries to use a Sexually suggestive tagged avatar in public or drop a portal to a Sexually suggestive world , It will boot them from the instance and into their home world. Their status will also be changed to red so no one can join them. Maybe even give them a time out for a week or something idk\n\nWe will also need a clear definition in the VRC SDK of what is considered Sexually suggestive. Any ways, I hope iv explained this well enough. Im sure stuff like this is easier said than done but Id love some feed back from staff, or even a nod would be fine",
